alet, or government quarter, when a car bomb exploded in the street outside. Eight people died in the blast, which damaged the offices of the prime minister, as well as the finance and oil ministries. Ms. Ryggen’s tapestry was torn and showered with splinters of glass and other flying debris.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 282, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 282}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 481, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 1199, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/arts/02ryggen4/02ryggen4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hannah Ryggen Wove Politics Into Her Gorgeous Tapestries', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyw