n destination like after a gunman killed 58 people in October? Weddings and gambling go on — but there is new vigilance as well.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/01/travel/las-vegas-after-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'What is the vacation destination like after a gunman killed 58 people in October? Weddings and gambling go on — but there is new vigilance as well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was sitting at a bar near the far-flung N Gates at Seattle-Tacoma International Airport, awaiting a flight to Nevada nearly six weeks after a high-stakes video poker player named Stephen Paddock killed 58 people and wounded hundreds more before taking his own life in Las Vegas. Heavily armed, Mr. Paddock fired on a crowd of 22,000 country music fans at an outdoor festival across the street from his room on the 32nd floor of the Mandalay Bay Resort and Casino on the far south end of the Las Vegas Strip, marking one of the deadliest mass shootings in American history.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/merlin_130104980_6d345c00-6271-4acb-a279-40d121285441-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/merlin_130104980_6d345c00-6271-4acb-a279-40d121285441-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/merlin_130104980_6d345c00-6271-4acb-a279-40d121285441-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 595, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/merlin_130104980_6d345c00-6271-4acb-a279-40d121285441-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1190, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/10vegas2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/10vegas2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/10/travel/10vegas2/10vegas2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Las Vegas After the Shooting: Renewing Vows, Embracing Community', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Vacation Destination After Its Night of Horror', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Las Vegas, Nev, Shooting (October, 2017)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-01T10:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Seely', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seely', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3b88ecc-d41d-54a9-b180-e9f51722293f', 'word_count': 1857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3b88ecc-d41d-54a9-b180-e9f51722293f'}, {'abstract': 'You may find pleasure in the elegant details of the pistachio cake, lemon semifreddo and Italian meringue in this baked alaska, or just in torching it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/01/magazine/ice-cream-cake-baked-alaska-meringue-pistachio-cake-lemon-semifreddo.html', 'snippet': 'You may find pleasure in the elegant details of the pistachio cake, lemon semifreddo and Italian meringue in this baked alaska, or just in torching it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Baked alaska is a simple ice-cream cake, but with the tension of a good novel (will the delicate protagonist — the ice cream — survive the flames?) and the beauty of a poem. “It was a work of art,” one guest said at the end of her meal. But nothing could be further from the truth. It’s all craft. And a lot of it! If you find as much meaning as I do in the painstaking details, you will find the project rewarding, especially because you can set it on fire and clap and giggle and then eat the damned thing. So maybe it’s not at all like a poem, in the art sense, where you do all that exacting work but then at the end realize it ought to be torched, and you go to bed without applause and still hungry to boot.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/magazine/03mag-eat2-promo/03eat2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/03/magazine/03mag-eat2-promo/03eat2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/magazine/03mag-eat2-promo/03eat2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/magazine/03mag-eat2-promo/03eat2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image