ose health risks for people not previously infected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/01/world/asia/philippines-dengue-vaccine.html', 'snippet': 'More than 740,000 students have already received Dengvaxia vaccinations, which could pose health risks for people not previously infected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANILA — The Philippines suspended its school-based dengue immunization program on Friday after the French pharmaceutical giant Sanofi warned that its flagship vaccine, Dengvaxia, had been found to pose health risks in people not previously infected.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/world/02vaccine2/02vaccine2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Philippines Suspends Dengue Shots After Drug Firm’s Warning', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Philippines Suspends Dengue Shots at Schools After Drug Maker’s Warning', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dengue Fever', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sanofi SA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philippines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-01T13:54:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Felipe Villamor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Felipe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Villamor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eaf8846a-3358-5c98-ad6a-ebc40d322fd0', 'word_count': 950, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eaf8846a-3358-5c98-ad6a-ebc40d322fd0'}, {'abstract': 'A by-no-means exhaustive list of the things our editors (and a few contributors) find interesting on a given week. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/01/t-magazine/prada-james-jean-oatmeal-art-hill-house-home-editors-picks.html', 'snippet': 'A by-no-means exhaustive list of the things our editors (and a few contributors) find interesting on a given week. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The psychedelic line-work of James Jean first found its way into Prada’s orbit 10 years ago — a time, he notes, when such partnerships were considerably rare — in the form of a wallpaper mural installed in the label’s New York store. Shortly thereafter, the Los Angeles-based visual artist lent his hand to Prada’s recognizable fairy print and then illustrated a splashy backdrop for its accompanying ad campaign, which displayed Technicolor-clothed models in a fantastic landscape — both of Jean’s invention — for spring/summer 2008. “They caught me at the tail-end of my commercial career,” he reflects. “I had been doing a lot of editorial and advertising, and I decided to stop and focus on purely personal stuff” — which he did, for a decade. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/01/t-magazine/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/01/t-magazine/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/01/t-magazine/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/01/t-magazine/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/01/t-magazine/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/01/t-magazine/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9/01tmag-tel-slide-0UZ9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/01/t-ma