 the Russians go out early.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/01/sports/soccer/fifa-world-cup-groups.html', 'snippet': 'The host country got a favorable draw, but it will be up to other teams, and to FIFA, to make the best of the situation if the Russians go out early.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Half a million fans — by current, suspiciously optimistic, estimates — will descend on Russia next year for what Gianni Infantino, the FIFA president, has already decreed will be the “best” World Cup in history.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/sports/soccer/02onsoccer2/merlin_130753608_6da16881-3ee5-46a4-8ebf-66533d15f44b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/02/sports/soccer/02onsoccer2/merlin_130753608_6da16881-3ee5-46a4-8ebf-66533d15f44b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/sports/soccer/02onsoccer2/merlin_130753608_6da16881-3ee5-46a4-8ebf-66533d15f44b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/sports/soccer/02onsoccer2/merlin_130753608_6da16881-3ee5-46a4-8ebf-66533d15f44b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1433, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/02/sports/soccer/02onsoccer2/02onsoccer2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/02/sports/soccer/02onsoccer2/02