ns about the sacred place of mate in Argentine society.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/02/opinion/sunday/argentina-yerba-mate-message.html', 'snippet': 'Dripping with snobbery, a voice message went viral and prompted a cascade of discussions about the sacred place of mate in Argentine society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cinthia Solange Dhers is a 53-year-old surgeon who recently bought an apartment in Nordelta, a gated community in one of the most upscale areas of Buenos Aires. But the neighborhood didn’t live up to her high standards, and she shared her disappointment with a friend in a voice message that ended up online.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/opinion/sunday/03Caparros1/merlin_71086031_b2e60658-6b25-4c83-8f49-ba2ff094c415-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/03/opinion/sunday/03Caparros1/merlin_71086031_b2e60658-6b25-4c83-8f49-ba2ff094c415-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/opinion/sunday/03Caparros1/merlin_71086031_b2e60658-6b25-4c83-8f49-ba2ff094c415-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/opinion/sunday/03Caparros1/merlin_71086031_b2e60658-6b25-4c83-8f49-ba2ff094c415-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/03/opinion/sunday/03Caparros1/03Caparros1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp