ge and humility.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/04/opinion/purity-is-overrated.html', 'snippet': 'To transcend our complicity in the world’s worst crises, we need self-knowledge and humility.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Meet Helen, a middle-aged woman newly devoted to Tibetan Buddhism, living in the American Midwest. She has recently taken a vow to limit and alleviate suffering in the world. She thinks one way to do this is to make a pilgrimage to Taktsang Monastery, or the Tiger Nest, in the mountains of Bhutan, to receive rare and precious teachings that will spiritually prepare her for her life of compassionate action. According to legend, the eighth-century Buddhist master Guru Rinpoche flew to this location from Tibet on the back of a tigress, but Helen takes a 737 from Kansas City, Mo.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04stoneWeb/04stoneWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Dark Times, ‘Dirty Hands’ Can Still Do Good', 'kicker': 'The Stone', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buddhism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philosophy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Personal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-04T10:45:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Kaag and Clancy Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaag', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Clancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/f08f544e-ec5d-5af3-8810-2a3117160f28', 'word_count': 1575, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f08f544e-ec5d-5af3-8810-2a3117160f28'}, {'abstract': 'The potential hammer at the heart of the Michael Flynn plea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/04/opinion/trump-team-flynn-logan-act.html', 'snippet': 'The potential hammer at the heart of the Michael Flynn plea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump’s former national security adviser, Michael Flynn, acknowledged in court last week that he lied to F.B.I. investigators about his communications with the Russian ambassador to the United States in the run-up to Mr. Trump’s inauguration. While Mr. Flynn pleaded guilty to only one count of making materially false statements, his admissions leave little doubt that he also violated a federal criminal statute known as the Logan Act. Mr. Flynn’s filings further reveal that a “very senior member” of the Trump transition team almost certainly violated the Logan Act, too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/04/opinion/04posner-hemel/04posner-hemel-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why the Trump Team Should Fear the Logan Act', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contribu