 much more aesthetic appeal and adds a bit of a workout, too. The Churncraft butter churn is at once sleek yet old-fashioned, heavy and effective. Using two quarts of heavy cream, in 10 to 15 minutes one can make more than a pound of golden butter, along with a bonus: several cups of buttermilk. Imagine a weekend morning with the family making butter, buttermilk and then the pancakes: Churncraft butter churn, $240; butter wrapping kit, $24; wooden paddles, $12; churncraft.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/dining/06burnerchurn/merlin_130632305_7a27c3df-b902-463f-a23b-0f5df03b638a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 459, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/06/dining/06burnerchurn/merlin_130632305_7a27c3df-b902-463f-a23b-0f5df03b638a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 459}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/dining/06burnerchurn/merlin_130632305_7a27c3df-b902-463f-a23b-0f5df03b638a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/dining/06burnerchurn/merlin_130632305_7a27c3df-b902-463f-a23b-0f5df03b638a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1568, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/dining/06burnerchurn/06butterchrun-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/06/dining/06burnerchurn/06butterchrun-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight