8a7f-ef5dd3bbadf5'}, {'abstract': 'This week President Trump sharply reduced the size of two monuments; plans for many others are unclear. What are these places like for visitors? We explored a few.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/06/travel/at-three-national-monuments-quiet-trails-and-questions-about-the-future.html', 'snippet': 'This week President Trump sharply reduced the size of two monuments; plans for many others are unclear. What are these places like for visitors? We explored a few.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jay and I wondered what the climb back out would be like as we made our way down a wide, smooth, but radically tilted carapace of sandstone toward Upper Calf Creek Falls. This was a “trail,” visible mostly as an imaginary line between rock cairns. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17escalante1/merlin_130834677_f75d7e14-8919-4020-bbc5-27f0f1c4449f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17escalante1/merlin_130834677_f75d7e14-8919-4020-bbc5-27f0f1c4449f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17escalante1/merlin_130834677_f75d7e14-8919-4020-bbc5-27f0f1c4449f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17escalante1/merlin_130834677_f75d7e14-8919-4020-bbc5-27f0f1c4449f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1318, 'width': 1992, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u