politics/tax-bill-obamacare-mandate-collins.html', 'snippet': 'House Republicans are embracing the Senate’s repeal of the health law’s mandate that most people have insurance, but they are not buying a side deal to stabilize insurance markets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — House and Senate negotiators thrashing out differences over a major tax bill are likely to eliminate the insurance coverage mandate at the heart of the Affordable Care Act, lawmakers say.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/07/us/politics/07dc-health1/merlin_130967315_178f3fdd-af42-47ad-8753-3c81dcaf88a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/07/us/politics/07dc-health1/merlin_130967315_178f3fdd-af42-47ad-8753-3c81dcaf88a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/07/us/politics/07dc-health1/merlin_130967315_178f3fdd-af42-47ad-8753-3c81dcaf88a8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/07/us/politics/07dc-health1/merlin_130967315_178f3fdd-af42-47ad-8753-3c81dcaf88a8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/07/us/politics/07dc-health1/07dc-health1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/07/us/politics/07dc-health1/07dc-health1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai