 that nevertheless set up plenty of jeopardy for next week’s Season 3 finale.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/06/arts/television/mr-robot-season-3-episode-9-introducing-stage-3.html', 'snippet': 'This week brought an uneven, somewhat draggy episode that nevertheless set up plenty of jeopardy for next week’s Season 3 finale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After last week’s surreal, poignant journey through Elliot’s emotional torment, “Mr. Robot” returned the plot to a full boil on Wednesday as onetime partners resumed tense relations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/06/watching/06robot/06robot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Mr. Robot’ Season 3, Episode 9: Introducing Stage 3', 'kicker': 'Mr. Robot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Mr Robot (TV Program)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-07T04:01:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeremy Egner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Egner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6e59023-4e94-5877-ba74-a9aa5579a365', 'word_count': 1345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6e59023-4e94-5877-ba74-a9aa5579a365'}, {'abstract': "Bridgeport, on Chicago's South Side, once had an outsiders-unwelcome reputation, Now the Daley family's storied neighborhood ranks among the city's most diverse hubs.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/07/travel/chicago-bridgeport-five-places.html', 'snippet': "Bridgeport, on Chicago's South Side, once had an outsiders-unwelcome reputation, Now the Daley family's storied neighborhood ranks among the city's most diverse hubs.", 'lead_paragraph': 'On Chicago’s South Side, quintessentially blue-collar Bridgeport is the city’s prime spot for catching a White Sox game, savoring a great taco or taking in the art scene. The Daley family’s storied neighborhood once had an Irish-only, outsiders-unwelcome reputation. Yet the enclave now ranks among the city’s most diverse, with a Buddhist temple alongside a  Benedictine monastery, and Mandarin, Spanish and Korean often overheard. Turn-of-the-century buildings are now galleries and art studios, and a zinc-skinned boathouse by the notable architect Jeanne Gang added a buzzy spot for rowing or practicing yoga along the Chicago River in late 2016. These new additions seem only to enhance the area’s workaday character.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/merlin_130600427_bb6794c0-5888-487f-a4ec-0307fcff9b80-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/merlin_130600427_bb6794c0-5888-487f-a4ec-0307fcff9b80-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/merlin_130600427_bb6794c0-5888-487f-a4ec-0307fcff9b80-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/merlin_130600427_bb6794c0-5888-487f-a4ec-0307fcff9b80-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/17Chicago2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/17Chicago2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/travel/17Chicago2/17Chicago2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Five Places to Go in Chicago', 'kicker': '5 Places', 