a” provided a glimpse at the post-Levine company, and offered reflections of social and political upheaval.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/07/arts/music/met-opera-norma-figaro-james-levine.html', 'snippet': 'Performances of “Le Nozze di Figaro” and “Norma” provided a glimpse at the post-Levine company, and offered reflections of social and political upheaval.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many look to opera as an escape. But returning to the Metropolitan Opera on Tuesday and Wednesday, for the first time since its revered music director emeritus, James Levine, was suspended amid accusations of sexual abuse, I couldn’t stop thinking about the recent social and political upheaval — both inside and outside the Met.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/arts/08metopera1/08metopera1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/08/arts/08metopera1/08metopera1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/arts/08metopera1/08metopera1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/arts/08metopera1/08metopera1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1498, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/arts/08metopera1/08metopera1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/08/arts/08metopera1/08me