denied-paul-cortez-catherine-woods.html', 'snippet': 'Lawyers believe a video raises doubts about a jury’s decision in 2007, but a judge didn’t believe there’s enough evidence to move toward a new trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An effort to win a new trial for a yoga teacher convicted of slashing the throat of a young dancer from Ohio in 2005 ran into a wall on Thursday when a State Supreme Court justice in Manhattan denied a request for a hearing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/nyregion/08murder/08murder-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 789, 'width': 526, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/nyregion/08murder/08murder-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 789, 'width': 526, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/nyregion/08murder/08murder-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/08/nyregion/08murder/08murder-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/nyregion/08murder/08murder-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hearing Denied for Yoga Teacher Convicted in Dancer’s 2005 Killing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yoga Teacher Loses Request For Murder Appeal Hearing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yoga', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 