ed United States marshal, has had some success with his own thrillers; “Brute Force” hit the e-book list last year. But this is his first outing as a ghostwriter for an actual ghost. “It was daunting, because these are such large characters,” he told me by phone from his home in Alaska. “I was a Clancy fan from the time I was a rookie policeman and read ‘The Hunt for Red October.’ I was 22.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1720, 'width': 1720, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/books/review/1217-BKS-LIST/1217-BKS-LIST-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150,