-8aef-0ed56a6f92f7'}, {'abstract': 'We asked readers from around the world to share their favorite song and a memory they associate with it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/08/arts/music/johnny-hallydays-fans-share-their-favorite-songs.html', 'snippet': 'We asked readers from around the world to share their favorite song and a memory they associate with it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Johnny Hallyday, who died this week, was loved by millions of fans around the world, but mostly in France. His body will travel down the Champs Elysées on Saturday, as part of a funeral procession involving hundreds of bikers. Large crowds are expected to attend and the French President, Emmanuel Macron, will speak at the funeral service.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/world/xxhallyday-voices/merlin_130952085_ba976955-def2-4e8d-956b-29568731256c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/08/world/xxhallyday-voices/merlin_130952085_ba976955-def2-4e8d-956b-29568731256c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/world/xxhallyday-voices/merlin_130952085_ba976955-def2-4e8d-956b-29568731256c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/world/xxhallyday-voices/merlin_130952085_ba976955-def2-4e8d-956b-29568731256c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/world/xxhallyday-voices/merlin_130952085_ba9769