he Trump, Obama and Bush administrations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/10/us/politics/epa-enforcement-methodology.html', 'snippet': 'Using information from a public database, the analysis covered activity during the first 266 days of E.P.A. leaders in the Trump, Obama and Bush administrations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The analysis by The New York Times of the Trump administration’s record in enforcing environmental regulations was based on data compiled by the Environmental Protection Agency and publicly available in its Enforcement and Compliance History Online database.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/11promo-epa/11promo-epa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/11/us/11promo-epa/11promo-epa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/11promo-epa/11promo-epa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/11promo-epa/11promo-epa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1261, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/11promo-epa/11promo-epa-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/11/us/11promo-epa/11promo-epa-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima