eir final appeals to voters Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/11/us/alabama-roy-moore-doug-jones.html', 'snippet': 'Amid a blur of question marks and conflicting polls, Roy S. Moore, the Republican, and Doug Jones, the Democrat, made their final appeals to voters Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Read the latest on the Alabama Senate race here with our live updates.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Alabama Senate Race, Unlikely Nail-Biter, Races to Finish Line', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Final Scramble In Erratic Race For Senate Seat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Doug (1954- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Roy S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shelby, Richard C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALABAMA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-11T19:02:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Blinder, Alexander Burns and Jonathan Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab18f5ec-cbed-5616-8eed-87a612941db6', 'word_count': 1529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab18f5ec-cbed-5616-8eed-87a612941db6'}, {'abstract': 'Le Thé Blanc from Kusmi Tea is a white tea delicately scented with raspberry and rose.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/11/dining/alain-ducasse-kusmi-tea.html', 'snippet': 'Le Thé Blanc from Kusmi Tea is a white tea delicately scented with raspberry and rose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the first time in its 150-year history, Kusmi Tea is introducing a white tea, a type made from the very first tea leaves that sprout in the spring. The Paris-based company collaborated with the chef Alain Ducasse on the blend, which includes green tea and is delicately scented with raspberry and rose. It comes in a handsome white canister. The company recommends brewing the tea for three minutes in water at 176 degrees Fahrenheit. The leaves can be steeped twice: Kusmi Tea Le Thé Blanc, 4.3 ounces, $49, Kusmi Tea Boutiques, kusmitea.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnertea/merlin_130632287_939a6dab-3e7b-4e00-8dc7-7edadbda7c68-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 579, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnertea/merlin_130632287_939a6dab-3e7b-4e00-8dc7-7edadbda7c68-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 579}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnertea/merlin_130632287_939a6dab-3e7b-4e00-8dc7-7edadbda7c68-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 989, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnertea/merlin_130632287_939a6dab-3e7b-4e00-8dc7-7edadbda7c68-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1977, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 