ining/marinated-sardines-trikalinos.html', 'snippet': 'Marinated sardines from Greece add a new twist to a Feast of the Seven Fishes antipasto platter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is an alluring addition to an antipasto platter for the Feast of the Seven Fishes: meaty cured sardines from Greece. A family that has been in the business of preserving fish for more than 100 years first marinates the sardines, then packs them in sunflower and olive oils. It is one of those items that deserve to be kept on hand: Trikalinos Marinated Sardine Fillets, $19.95 for seven ounces, Lucy’s Whey, 1417 Lexington Avenue (East 93rd Street), 212-289-8900, lucyswhey.com or rogerscollection.us; shipping available.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnerfish/merlin_130914932_fec8d513-5dcf-4d58-a9f9-88fcee4542cb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnerfish/merlin_130914932_fec8d513-5dcf-4d58-a9f9-88fcee4542cb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnerfish/merlin_130914932_fec8d513-5dcf-4d58-a9f9-88fcee4542cb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnerfish/merlin_130914932_fec8d513-5dcf-4d58-a9f9-88fcee4542cb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13burnerfish/13fish-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 7