Mr. Mnuchin’s Magical Math', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mnuchin, Steven T', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-12T00:42:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/dcdc3ae2-3697-5e46-8b1f-2eb1f2f393fc', 'word_count': 451, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dcdc3ae2-3697-5e46-8b1f-2eb1f2f393fc'}, {'abstract': 'For the first time, some former Trump aides put their name to describing the president’s habits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/11/us/politics/campaign-memoir-trump-lewandowski-bossie.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time, some former Trump aides put their name to describing the president’s habits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump likes gold fixtures, marble tiles and the trappings of grandeur. When he talks about himself in interviews and in his books, he talks in superlatives. He has billed himself as masterful negotiator. He has described himself as having the world’s best memory. He almost never apologizes, and he rarely admits to having flaws.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarg