': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f91cf5a-1a8a-5a42-9b20-afa27f03513e', 'word_count': 1272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f91cf5a-1a8a-5a42-9b20-afa27f03513e'}, {'abstract': 'After years of losing, Stanton was unwilling to sit through an extended rebuilding process, so instead he will team with fellow slugger Aaron Judge in the Bronx.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/11/sports/baseball/giancarlo-stanton-yankees-marlins.html', 'snippet': 'After years of losing, Stanton was unwilling to sit through an extended rebuilding process, so instead he will team with fellow slugger Aaron Judge in the Bronx.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAKE BUENA VISTA, Fla. — Under different circumstances, Giancarlo Stanton might have raised his new pinstriped jersey, with No. 27 on the back, and explained that the “2” was for Derek Jeter and the “7” for Mickey Mantle. He could have talked about idolizing Jeter and hoping to belt homers like Mantle.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/sports/baseball/12kepner-01p/12kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/12/sports/baseball/12kepner-01p/12kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/sports/baseball/12kepner-01p/12kepner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/sports/baseball/12kepner-01p/12kepner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1406, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i