 All? Let’s Discuss', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2017-12-12T17:47:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Watching', 'section_name': 'Watching', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Berman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/22722bc8-f39f-548e-acf1-8c7bf324604e', 'word_count': 1630, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22722bc8-f39f-548e-acf1-8c7bf324604e'}, {'abstract': 'Recent commercial real estate transactions in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/12/realestate/commercial/recent-commercial-real-estate-transactions.html', 'snippet': 'Recent commercial real estate transactions in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': '$58/SQ. FT.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/realestate/commercial/13trans1/13trans1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/realestate/commercial/13trans1/13trans1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 807}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/realestate/commercial/13trans1/13trans1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 762, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/realestate/commercial/13trans1/13trans1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1523, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 