oupe, one of the French West Indies (or Antilles), and it very narrowly escaped annihilation by Hurricane Irma. Doesn’t it feel like if you spun a globe and blindly set your finger down, if you didn’t find yourself in the middle of the sea you would probably hit a spot where some natural cataclysm had just happened (or was in the process of devastation now)? Beauty is fleeting and fragile, and it can lift or break your heart, can’t it!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/crosswords/13wordplay-french-antilles/places-to-visit2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/crosswords/13wordplay-french-antilles/places-to-visit2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/crosswords/13wordplay-french-antilles/places-to-visit2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/crosswords/13wordplay-french-antilles/places-to-visit2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/crosswords/13wordplay-french-antilles/places-to-visit2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/13/crosswords/13wordplay-french-antilles/places-to-visit2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/c