/article/94b9de9f-cf25-5ce6-8cba-bd9ea01fe927'}, {'abstract': 'In his first trip to Madison Square Garden as a Laker, Ball had a respectable night, but the Knicks edged out a win in overtime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/12/sports/lonzo-ball-gets-a-chorus-of-boos-as-lakers-fall-to-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'In his first trip to Madison Square Garden as a Laker, Ball had a respectable night, but the Knicks edged out a win in overtime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Luke Walton has experience dealing with stars under a microscope. As an assistant coach for Golden State, he was on staff during the Warriors’ 2014-15 championship season and the following year, when they won 73 games. He played alongside Kobe Bryant and Shaquille O’Neal as they wrestled for control of the Lakers during the early part of his playing career.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/sports/13KNICKS-01p/13KNICKS-01p-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/sports/13KNICKS-01p/13KNICKS-01p-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/sports/13KNICKS-01p/13KNICKS-01p-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/sports/13KNICKS-01p/13KNICKS-01p-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/sports/13KNICKS-01p/13KNICKS-01p-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy