0949ef7-223e-58a5-9aaf-7250a44ba5a8'}, {'abstract': 'House and Senate negotiators reached an agreement on a final bill, and are on track to send it to President Trump by Christmas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/13/us/politics/tax-bill-republicans-deal.html', 'snippet': 'House and Senate negotiators reached an agreement on a final bill, and are on track to send it to President Trump by Christmas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The day after suffering a political blow in the Alabama special Senate election, congressional Republicans sped forward with the most sweeping tax rewrite in decades, announcing an agreement on a final bill that would cut taxes for businesses and individuals and signal the party’s first major legislative achievement since assuming political control this year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/us/14dc-trumptax-alpha/14dc-trumptax-alpha-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/us/14dc-trumptax-alpha/14dc-trumptax-alpha-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/us/14dc-trumptax-alpha/14dc-trumptax-alpha-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/us/14dc-trumptax-alpha/14dc-trumptax-alpha-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/us/14dc-trumptax-alpha/14dc-trumptax-alpha-thumbStandard-v2