0f2d-3408-5ff2-9c92-2779fcdb6a37'}, {'abstract': 'The sci-fi drama is written and directed by Alex Garland, the filmmaker behind “Ex Machina.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/13/movies/trailer-annihilation-natalie-portman-alex-garland.html', 'snippet': 'The sci-fi drama is written and directed by Alex Garland, the filmmaker behind “Ex Machina.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Back in September, Paramount released a teaser for its sci-fi drama “Annihilation” that focused on Natalie Portman’s character, a biologist, leading an all-female team into a jungle populated with dangerous otherworldly creatures. Now a new trailer emphasizes the story’s emotional underpinning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 219, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 219}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-jumbo.png', 'height': 374, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 455, 'width': 1246, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/movies/14annihilation-trailer1/14annihilation-trailer1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Trailer: ‘Annihilation,’ Starring Natalie Portman', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garland, Alex', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Portman, Natalie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Annihilation (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-13T18:55:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Fretts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fretts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fac28f1-d79c-53ed-a8fb-e7d5ab12e370', 'word_count': 231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fac28f1-d79c-53ed-a8fb-e7d5ab12e370'}, {'abstract': 'It’s bad politics as well as bad policy, but Republicans either don’t get that or don’t care.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/13/opinion/scam-i-am-why-is-the-gop-rushing-this-tax-abomination.html', 'snippet': 'It’s bad politics as well as bad policy, but Republicans either don’t get that or don’t care.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So, it seems that Republicans are responding to the devastating defeat in Alabama – which is part of a sustained pattern of underperformance in special elections, demonstrating that bad polls reflect reality, not bad polling, by … doubling down on a massively unpopular tax plan, whose main focus is on cutting corporate taxes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/opinion/121317krugmanblog1/121317krugmanblog1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Scam I Am: Why Is the G.O.P. Rushing This Tax Abomination?', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value':