', 'word_count': 738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a566f1d0-6b61-533f-879f-5373030890c0'}, {'abstract': 'The fifth increase in the Federal Reserve benchmark interest rate since the financial crisis will have a ripple effect on all types of consumer borrowing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/13/business/fed-rate-mortgages-loans-credit.html', 'snippet': 'The fifth increase in the Federal Reserve benchmark interest rate since the financial crisis will have a ripple effect on all types of consumer borrowing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Federal Reserve’s decision to raise its benchmark interest rate on Wednesday, the fifth increase since the financial crisis, will probably reach beyond Wall Street and into most American homes.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/business/14CONSUMER-01p/merlin_131215094_f625d05a-fa88-4b65-ba9e-bb3fb26e6368-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/14/business/14CONSUMER-01p/merlin_131215094_f625d05a-fa88-4b65-ba9e-bb3fb26e6368-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/business/14CONSUMER-01p/merlin_131215094_f625d05a-fa88-4b65-ba9e-bb3fb26e6368-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/business/14CONSUMER-01p/merlin_131215094_f625d05a-fa88-4b65-ba9e-bb3fb26e6368-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/busine