School, Rick Rojas partnered with Kristin Hussey to return to a town reshaped by trauma.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the most difficult aspects of being a reporter is that the job often forces you to run toward the wickedness in the world and stare it in the face. Yet, confoundingly, that’s when the work can be its most gratifying; I’ve often witnessed people’s enormous capacity for love, generosity and resilience in those moments. Think of it as Newton’s third law in action: With the bad, sometimes I find an equal, opposing good.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2ITT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2ITT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2ITT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2ITT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1370, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2ITT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2ITT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/14/pageoneplus/14a2ITT/14a2I