rs Rashaun Mitchell and Silas Riener in this multimedia production at the Brooklyn Academy of Music.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/14/arts/dance/tesseract-review-brooklyn-academy-of-music.html', 'snippet': 'The filmmaker Charles Atlas works with the choreographers Rashaun Mitchell and Silas Riener in this multimedia production at the Brooklyn Academy of Music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not so very long ago, in a galaxy not so far away — on our own little planet, in fact — the choreographer Merce Cunningham radically altered stage space, decentralizing it, seeming to offer theater audiences multiple perspectives at once. Cunningham was interested in technology, too, and with the filmmaker Charles Atlas, he undertook some of the most successful experiments in using television and video as media for high-art dance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/arts/15TESSERACT-1/15TESSERACT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/15/arts/15TESSERACT-1/15TESSERACT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/arts/15TESSERACT-1/15TESSERACT-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/arts/15TESSERACT-1/15TESSERACT-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/arts/15TESSERACT-1/15TESSERACT-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand