'uri': 'nyt://article/fff625cb-e831-502c-aad2-cba4061f964d'}, {'abstract': 'Disney’s acquisition of a large portion of 21st Century Fox is a historic deal for Rupert Murdoch — and it should erase the discount afflicting his long-suffering shareholders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/14/business/dealbook/disney-murdoch.html', 'snippet': 'Disney’s acquisition of a large portion of 21st Century Fox is a historic deal for Rupert Murdoch — and it should erase the discount afflicting his long-suffering shareholders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Walt Disney Company is expanding its Magic Kingdom to include the Murdoch empire. It is paying $52.4 billion in stock to own a slimmed-down 21st Century Fox, including the movie studio and a 39 percent stake in Sky. It’s a historic deal for Fox’s Rupert Murdoch — and it should erase the discount afflicting the media mogul’s long-suffering shareholders.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/business/dealbook/15db-viewsfox1/merlin_131283561_972d99af-d1e6-418c-afcb-75dda501c4af-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 456, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/15/business/dealbook/15db-viewsfox1/merlin_131283561_972d99af-d1e6-418c-afcb-75dda501c4af-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 456}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/business/dealbook/15db-viewsfox1/merlin_131283561_972d99af-d1e6-418c-afcb-75dda501c4af-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 779, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/15/business/dealbook/15db-viewsfox1/merlin_131283561_972d99af-d1e6-418c-afcb-75dda501c4af-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1558, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'sup