l', 'snippet': 'It seems every podcast company is starting its own counterintuitive take on history. But how effective are they at actually illuminating our past?', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard to overstate the impact of “Revisionist History” on the podcast landscape. Last year, its three-minute trailer hit No. 1 on Apple’s charts. The show’s success partly reflects the presence of a celebrity host, the proto-TED Talk sage Malcolm Gladwell. When the second season dropped this summer, Mr. Gladwell’s return was feted on the morning shows and in the Sunday Styles section of The New York Times.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/16/arts/history-podcast-hess/history-podcast-hess-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/16/arts/history-podcast-hess/history-podcast-hess-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/16/arts/history-podcast-hess/history-podcast-hess-jumbo.gif', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/16/arts/history-podcast-hess/history-podcast-hess-superJumbo-v8.gif', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/16/arts/history-podcast-hess/history-podcast-hess-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/16/arts/history-podcast-hess/history-podcast-hess-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbna