2283', 'word_count': 1204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d61d3f28-74fd-59b7-831c-d488b7082283'}, {'abstract': 'The defeat of the Islamic State is part of a surprisingly effective Middle East approach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/16/opinion/sunday/war-trump-islamic-state.html', 'snippet': 'The defeat of the Islamic State is part of a surprisingly effective Middle East approach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is nothing more characteristic of the Trump era, with its fire hose of misinformation, scandal and hyperbole, than that America and its allies recently managed to win a war that just two years ago consumed headlines and dominated political debate and helped Donald Trump himself get elected president — and somehow nobody seemed to notice.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/opinion/sunday/17douthat/merlin_131284449_6f306470-6a0b-4642-aa5e-09da64b72a55-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/17/opinion/sunday/17douthat/merlin_131284449_6f306470-6a0b-4642-aa5e-09da64b72a55-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/opinion/sunday/17douthat/merlin_131284449_6f306470-6a0b-4642-aa5e-09da64b72a55-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/17/opinion/sunday/17douthat/merlin_131284449_6f306470-6a0b-4642-aa5e-09da64b72a55-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'