“Marjorie Prime,” where holograms, or “primes,” take the place of deceased loved ones. Ms. Smith could become the second oldest acting nominee ever. (Gloria Stuart, of “Titanic,” holds the record at 87 years, 5 months old; Ms. Smith, if nominated, would be 87 and 2 months.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/05/arts/05bagger-prince-smithskybox/12bagger-prince-smith1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumb