ess-resolution-stick.html', 'snippet': 'Many Americans will make getting fit and losing weight a New Year’s resolution. Unfortunately, the odds are overwhelming that they’ll fail.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a doctor of sports medicine, I frequently hear a similar line from my patients: “Doc, I’m 20 pounds overweight. I’ve got three kids, a mortgage and a 45-minute commute. I know I need to move more and lose a few pounds, but I seem to be heading in the wrong direction. What can I do?”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 298, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 298}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/well/well-resolutions1/well-resolutions-thumbL