wear a crown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/20/magazine/galette-rois-france-epiphany-pastry-king-queen.html', 'snippet': 'A galette des rois is as much a game as a dessert, and the winner gets to wear a crown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Winter in Paris always surprises me. From one January to the next, I forget how very short the days are, how damp the air is, how often it seems we’re on the brink of snow but how seldom it arrives, how rare a day of sunshine is and then how weak the light can be. But January brings compensatory pleasures: hot chocolate, vin chaud (a mix of mulled wine, brandy and orange), roasted chestnuts bought on the street, freshly griddled crepes rolled into paper cones and the galette des rois, a pastry sold only during this gray month.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-ondessert1-promo-copy/24mag-24ondessert-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-ondessert1-promo-copy/24mag-24ondessert-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-ondessert1-promo-copy/24mag-24ondessert-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-ondessert1-promo-copy/24mag-24ondessert-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1338, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-ondessert1-pr