/20/arts/dance/michelle-dorrance-review-joyce-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Michelle Dorrance’s show at the Joyce confirms her command of her form.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michelle Dorrance’s newly expanded work “Myelination” takes its title from science. It refers to the formation of myelin sheaths around neurons, a process that speeds up the transmission of nerve impulses — and an apt analogy for a dance brimming with electricity, with movement so swift it defies comprehension. For Ms. Dorrance, the impulses are rhythmic — her medium is tap — and they travel among the dancers with the efficiency and inevitability of a biological phenomenon.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/arts/21dorrance-review1/21dorrance-review1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/21/arts/21dorrance-review1/21dorrance-review1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/arts/21dorrance-review1/21dorrance-review1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/arts/21dorrance-review1/21dorrance-review1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/arts/21dorrance-review1/21dorrance-review1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/21/arts/21dorrance-review1/21dorrance-review1-thumbSt