nizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Evasion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-20T19:20:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd546502-0ad7-5a72-a502-a230ee6db3de', 'word_count': 607, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd546502-0ad7-5a72-a502-a230ee6db3de'}, {'abstract': 'The decision by Mr. al-Hussein, high commissioner for human rights, appeared to reflect tensions over his criticism of the Trump administration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/20/world/un-human-rights-al-hussein.html', 'snippet': 'The decision by Mr. al-Hussein, high commissioner for human rights, appeared to reflect tensions over his criticism of the Trump administration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — The United Nations High Commissioner for human rights, who has openly criticized powerful governments, including the Trump administration, has made the unusual decision to not seek a second four-year term, saying it “might involve bending a knee in supplication.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/world/21nations/merlin_130903047_fff2bd83-0f21-4ab0-8db3-1a1c5ea7ba9f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/21/world/21nations/merlin_130903047_fff2bd83-0f21-4ab0-8db3-1a1c5ea7ba9f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/world/21nations/merlin_130903047_fff2bd83-0f21-4