iborne Ray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'C.', 'middlename': 'Claiborne', 'lastname': 'Ray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/2623ac22-1934-5ef1-a36a-3669e587a667', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2623ac22-1934-5ef1-a36a-3669e587a667'}, {'abstract': 'A chaplain is part of the team for about three-quarters of England’s professional teams, offering spiritual or secular counseling to the players. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/21/sports/soccer/chaplains-soccer-england-.html', 'snippet': 'A chaplain is part of the team for about three-quarters of England’s professional teams, offering spiritual or secular counseling to the players. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The work is done over a quiet cup of coffee, in the privacy of the physiotherapist’s room, or through a brief chat on the touchline after training. It might be no more than a quick text message or email, asking if everything is O.K. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/sports/24CHAPLAINSweb-notts3/merlin_131472371_3920c292-3748-4158-a790-f95df40de02f-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In an Unforgiving Sport, They Minister to Hearts and Souls', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tending to the Spirit  In an Unforgiving Sport', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chaplains', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-21T10:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rory Smith and Rob Stothard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stothard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/357fbfcd-4b50-5b46-9250-8071fc38d755', 'word_count': 2551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/357fbfcd-4b50-5b46-9250-8071fc38d755'}, {'abstract': 'Born a conservative idea, maturing as a bipartisan one, then tagged a Democratic invention, it survived many attacks but fell victim to the G.O.P. tax plan. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/21/upshot/individual-health-insurance-mandate-end-impact.html', 'snippet': 'Born a conservative idea, maturing as a bipartisan one, then tagged a Democratic invention, it survived many attacks but fell victim to the G.O.P. tax plan. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The individual mandate, an idea inspired by conservative intellectuals but ultimately embraced by Democratic lawmakers as an essential part of the Affordable Care Act, will soon be dead. The provision would be eliminated under the tax bill passed on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 229, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 229}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/21/upshot/21up-mandate1/21up-mandate1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Requiem for the Individual Mandate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'End of a Conservative Idea Turned Democratic Policy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-21T10:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margot Sanger-Katz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margot', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanger-Katz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b034348-ef88-5a04-9bbb-016470c02a0e', 'word_count': 992, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b034348-ef88-5a04-9bbb-016470c02a0e'}, {'abstract': 'A rich feast of seared scallops, roast duck and hollandaise sauce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/21/magazine/scallops-duck-hollandaise-joyous-excess-holidays.html', 'snippet': 'A rich feast of seared scallops, roast duck and hollandaise sauce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you had told me, back in my 20s, how great it would be to spend Christmas Eve cooking for family as someone rustles wrapping paper in the living room and the dog snores at my feet, I wouldn’t have believed you, would have scoffed like a Gen-X Scrooge. I was content then to hold up the bar with friends and strangers, to drain Rolling Rocks and sing “Fairytale of New York,” take a swing and a miss at the midnight service, then trudge the long walk home in the cold. I’m not any longer. I cook and serve others food that is both fantastical and rich, to allow all who eat it to sleep through whatever late-night shenanigans put gifts under the tree, and to rise in the morning Christmas-excited. My children are teenagers now. But I believe they still slightly believe. The dinner helps.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-eat1-promo-copy/24mag-24eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-eat1-promo-copy/24mag-24eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-eat1-promo-copy/24mag-24eat-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-eat1-promo-copy/24mag-24eat-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/24/magazine/24mag-eat1-p