ion of the days of gin and tonics at the club and discreet bed-hopping in the officers’ quarters.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/22last-post/22last-post-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘The Last Post’ Shows an Empire Awash in Adultery and Gin and Tonics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Empire Takes a Hit Softened With Nostalgia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moffat, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Raine, Jessica (1982- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Last Post (TV Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-21T20:27:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f414b65a-0933-5ca9-9826-c3519e1878a3', 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f414b65a-0933-5ca9-9826-c3519e1878a3'}, {'abstract': 'For a special holiday dinner, go beyond coq au vin, with rich duck and earthy lentils instead of the usual chicken and potatoes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/21/dining/duck-lentils-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'For a special holiday dinner, go beyond coq au vin, with rich duck and earthy lentils instead of the usual chicken and potatoes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I like beans all year round, but I especially appreciate them in winter. A plate of pinto beans studded with hunks of smoky, long-cooked bacon, for me, is a special feast. Or cannellini beans stewed with olive oil and herbs, or a steaming bowl of spicy black bean soup. I’m a lentil fan, too. I like them in nearly any guise, from any of the world’s cuisines.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27kitchen1/merlin_130646408_b73fa9ac-b7d2-48ad-8a86-74721c737439-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge',