 fuel, shipping and contract workers come less than a month after North Korea tested its most powerful ballistic missile.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/21/world/asia/us-un-north-korea-sanctions.html', 'snippet': 'The proposed limits on fuel, shipping and contract workers come less than a month after North Korea tested its most powerful ballistic missile.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — The United States circulated a proposed resolution to the United Nations Security Council on Thursday that would further choke North Korea’s economy, with a near total ban on fuel imports, a tightening of restrictions on shipping and a one-year deadline for most North Korean laborers working under contracts abroad to go home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/world/22nkworkers1_xp/22nkworkers1_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/22/world/22nkworkers1_xp/22nkworkers1_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/world/22nkworkers1_xp/22nkworkers1_xp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/world/22nkworkers1_xp/22nkworkers1_xp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/world/22nkworkers1_xp/22nkworkers1_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/22/world/22nkworkers1_xp/