i': 'nyt://article/26a3b059-0055-5e7b-a696-655d5dbb76ef'}, {'abstract': 'Officers in the Grand Rapids Police Department in Michigan handcuffed the girl, Honestie Hodges, but an internal investigation found that they had not violated any policy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/21/us/grand-rapids-police-honestie-hodges.html', 'snippet': 'Officers in the Grand Rapids Police Department in Michigan handcuffed the girl, Honestie Hodges, but an internal investigation found that they had not violated any policy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The police chief in Grand Rapids, Mich., who criticized his own officers this month for handcuffing an innocent 11-year-old girl, said this week that none of them would be disciplined for the episode.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/us/22xp-Grand-Rapids1/22xp-Grand-Rapids1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/22/us/22xp-Grand-Rapids1/22xp-Grand-Rapids1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/us/22xp-Grand-Rapids1/22xp-Grand-Rapids1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/us/22xp-Grand-Rapids1/22xp-Grand-Rapids1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/us/22xp-Grand-Rapids1/22xp-Grand-Rapids1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/