uru-spends-her-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Thomas takes luxurious baths, runs with her fiancé along the West Side Highway, goes to brunch with friends, and listens to her son play guitar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the founder of Mama Glow, a wellness resource for both expecting and new mothers, Latham Thomas has made a career out of teaching self-care to women all over the world. Sunday is when she practices what she preaches. “I want to be with my son and fiancé and show myself some love,” she said. Ms. Thomas, 37, lives in Chelsea with Thomas Rasmussen, 55, who works in finance, and her 14-year-old son, Fulano Librizzi, who is a D.J.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/12/nyregion/31routine10/31routine10-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Latham Thomas, Wellness Guru, Spends Her Sundays', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Roses on the Water, Nachos With Friends', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Latham', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Therapy and Rehabilitation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veganism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chelsea (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Williamsburg (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-22T12:00:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metropolitan', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shivani Vora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shivani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f8c97f8-d1ba-5b06-8f69-dcc371f3d9ad', 'word_count': 768, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f8c97f8-d1ba-5b06-8f69-dcc371f3d9ad'}, {'abstract': 'It’s a big city, with plenty to do, see, hear and watch. Here’s a sampling of cultural highlights this weekend and over the week ahead. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/22/arts/10-things-to-do-in-nyc-now-gilbertgottfried.html', 'snippet': 'It’s a big city, with plenty to do, see, hear and watch. Here’s a sampling of cultural highlights this weekend and over the week ahead. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a reason George Balanchine, City Ballet’s legendary founder, gets title billing in this version of the holiday tradition: It very much bears his unique blend of sophistication and joy. Of the many productions of this tale in town, “George Balanchine’s The Nutcracker,” now through Dec. 31, is most likely to satisfy adults with its visual splendor and breathtaking dance. The children, of course, will cheer the lively characters, colorful costumes and that gargantuan magical tree. This week, 10 stellar ballerinas trade off in the showcase role of the Sugarplum, from elegant, established principles like Sterling Hyltin (Dec. 23 evening) and Sara Mearns (Dec. 26 evening) to exciting new soloists like Unity Phelan (Dec. 22 evening, Dec. 27 matinee) and Emilie Gerrity (Dec. 26 matinee). BRIAN SCHAEFER', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/20listings-dance/20listings-dance-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/20listings-dance/20listings-dance-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/20listings-dance/20listings-dance-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/20listings-dance/20listings-dance-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/20listings-dance/20listings-dance-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/22/arts/20listing