ans in the country who have escaped the harshest punishments for breaking laws.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/22/business/korea-lotte-corruption-conviction.html', 'snippet': 'Shin Dong-bin received a suspended sentence, extending a long list of business titans in the country who have escaped the harshest punishments for breaking laws.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A court in Seoul, South Korea, on Friday convicted Shin Dong-bin, the chairman of the multinational Lotte Group, of embezzlement and breach of trust in connection with a corruption scandal, according to the Yonhap news agency.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/business/lotte-img/merlin_131546321_b3a18b92-cd92-4efe-9513-e4192b6ca824-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/22/business/lotte-img/merlin_131546321_b3a18b92-cd92-4efe-9513-e4192b6ca824-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/business/lotte-img/merlin_131546321_b3a18b92-cd92-4efe-9513-e4192b6ca824-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/business/lotte-img/merlin_131546321_b3a18b92-cd92-4efe-9513-e4192b6ca824-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/22/business/lotte-img/lotte-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images