over a 60-year career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dick Enberg, the sportscaster known for his warm voice and signature expression, “Oh, my!” when beholding a game-winning home run or a brilliant volley at Wimbledon, died on Thursday at his home in the San Diego enclave of La Jolla. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/sports/23enberg-obit-1/22enberg-obit-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dick Enberg, Veteran Sportscaster, Is Dead at 82', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dick Enberg, Sports’ Warm and Familiar Play-by-Play Voice, Is Dead at 82', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Enberg, Dick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-22T19:13:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/f20b08aa-9b89-58ed-ac28-520456745a84', 'word_count': 1726, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f20b08aa-9b89-58ed-ac28-520456745a84'}, {'abstract': 'If your phone’s photos have stopped automatically uploading to the online file-storage service, check your settings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/22/technology/personaltech/iphone-pictures-dropbox.html', 'snippet': 'If your phone’s photos have stopped automatically uploading to the online file-storage service, check your settings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. I had my iPhone and iPad set up to send all my photos to my Dropbox account, so I could access them on my PC. Suddenly, about six weeks ago, they no longer do this and I can’t figure out how to reset it so they will. It is possible that I told my iPhone to send my photos to the iCloud library on that day, but I don’t remember for sure. Please help!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1067, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1067}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 576, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1152, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/23/technology/personaltech/23techtipwebART/23techtipwebART-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Resuming Cam