hether to cut off his adult son. In both cases, money comes with strings attached.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/23/podcasts/listen-to-dear-sugars-cutting-the-financial-cordwith-dr-kate-gale.html', 'snippet': 'The Sugars answer a letter from a woman whose parents refuse to give her financial independence and a father weighing whether to cut off his adult son. In both cases, money comes with strings attached.', 'lead_paragraph': '“My son and I had a falling out two and a half years ago,” begins a letter from a divorced father calling himself “Father of Three, Acquaintance of One.” “My legal responsibility for financially supporting him ends next year when he turns 18. I could certainly opt to continue providing that support but should I?”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum