'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/25/arts/dance/robert-fairchild-mary-shelleys-frankenstein-ensemble-for-romantic-century.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Fairchild is playing Frankenstein’s monster — and making choreography that reveals the monster’s inner life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not too long ago, Robert Fairchild played a young god — Apollo — at New York City Ballet. Now, just two months after retiring from the company to try his luck in musical theater, he finds himself contorting his body to become one of the world’s most famous monsters.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/arts/27fairchildenstein1/27fairchildenstein1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 741, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/27/arts/27fairchildenstein1/27fairchildenstein1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 741}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/arts/27fairchildenstein1/27fairchildenstein1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 830, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/arts/27fairchildenstein1/27fairchildenstein1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1660, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/arts/27fairchildenstein1/27fairchildenstein1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/27/arts/27fairchildenstein1/27fairchildenstein1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLar