y intertwined.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/26/insider/a-boy-his-mother-and-the-human-being-behind-the-camera-leslye-davis-51-49.html', 'snippet': 'Over the five years that Leslye Davis followed Drew — starting when he was 14 and she was in journalism school — their lives became deeply intertwined.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RADCLIFF, Ky. — A purring air-conditioner and the distant warble of a television acted as a sonata on a stifling May afternoon in 2012. Regina Hensley, 45, initiated a dance with her son, Andrew Holland, 15.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/08/insider/holland-9/holland-9-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Boy, His Mother and the Human Being Behind the Camera', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Regina Hensley', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andrew Holland', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-26T17:35:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Insider', 'section_name': 'Times Insider', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leslye Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslye', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19c69455-fa7d-5987-bcf9-f7fa6436b8b7', 'word_count': 2311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19c69455-fa7d-5987-bcf9-f7fa6436b8b7'}, {'abstract': 'A new ramen bar at Brushstroke, Shanghai soup dumplings in Midtown Manhattan, and other restaurant news.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/26/dining/jade-sixty-nyc-restaurant-news.html', 'snippet': 'A new ramen bar at Brushstroke, Shanghai soup dumplings in Midtown Manhattan, and other restaurant news.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JADE SIXTY A good portion of the menu at this new restaurant is pure New York steakhouse: nine cuts of beef, surf & turf, whole chicken and seafood platters. But the rest of the menu looks to Asia for inspiration, offering soup dumplings, chicken won tons, rock shrimp tempura, chicken yakitori, crispy spring rolls and a deep list of sushi specialties. The restaurateur Stratis Morfogen, who has partnered with the former owner of Rothmann’s, Franco Moscato, for this venture, said this restaurant is not a typical Asian steakhouse, like the Korean and Japanese places around town. “There’s nothing Asian about the steaks,” he said. “But everything else is Asian.” Skinny Mei, who was at Philippe and Jue Lan Club, and Albert Diaz, who was the head chef at Zuma in London and Miami, run the kitchen. The 175-seat restaurant, dramatically done in gray and black with plush red banquettes and clusters of globe lights, has a bar on the ground floor, a dining room a half-flight up and another dining room on the next level. It will serve lunch and dinner on opening day. (Opens Tuesday): 116 East 60th Street, 212-256-1929, jadesixty.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27Off-Sub/27Off-Sub-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27Off-Sub/27Off-Sub-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27Off-Sub/27Off-Sub-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27Off-Sub/27Off-Sub-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27Off-Sub/27Off-Sub-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/27/dining/27Off-Sub/27Off-Sub-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth