lege friend asked you to support her quarterly magazine for her birthday. Or maybe your neighbor nudged you to donate to his favorite food bank on “Giving Tuesday” the week after Thanksgiving. And then there’s that pesky public-health nonprofit you’ve been charitable to in the past.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/00FBdonations_xp/00FBdonations_xp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/00FBdonations_xp/00FBdonations_xp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/00FBdonations_xp/00FBdonations_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/11/us/00FBdonations_xp/00FBdonations_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/11/us/00FBdonations_xp/00FBdonations_xp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yes, More Facebook Friends Are Asking You for Money', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nonprofit Organizations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_d