3f65cea', 'word_count': 84, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c832ace-886c-5120-99cb-be1173f65cea'}, {'abstract': 'He presided over two of the most ambitious development proposals in New York City history: a superhighway in Manhattan and revival of Times Square.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/26/obituaries/thomas-p-griesa-dead-judge-in-westway-dispute.html', 'snippet': 'He presided over two of the most ambitious development proposals in New York City history: a superhighway in Manhattan and revival of Times Square.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thomas P. Griesa, a federal judge whose far-reaching, environmentally based rulings helped kill the bitterly contested plan to build the Westway superhighway in Manhattan along the Hudson River but cleared the way for a huge redevelopment of Times Square, died on Sunday at his home in Manhattan. He was 87.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/business/27griesa-obit1/dbpix-argentina-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/27/business/27griesa-obit1/dbpix-argentina-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 553}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/business/27griesa-obit1/dbpix-argentina-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 943, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/business/27griesa-obit1/dbpix-argentina-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1886, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/27/business/27griesa-obit1/dbpix-argentina