 in mountains of powder and ice, forcing residents to abandon their incapacitated cars and shattering several snowfall records.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Erie, Pa., Buried in Five Feet of Snow After Record-Breaking Storm', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Record Storm Buries Erie, Pa., in Five Feet of Snow', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Erie (Pa)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-27T03:20:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Stevens and Sandra E. Garcia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stevens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Sandra', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Garcia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/acad7199-e293-5690-9aa9-98476ddcc899', 'word_count': 576, 'uri': 'nyt://article/acad7199-e293-5690-9aa9-98476ddcc899'}, {'abstract': 'Swimming in this sun-baked desert oasis is to tour midcentury modernism as seen through its famously fabulous pools. An astonishing 40,000 pools are within the city limits. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/27/travel/palm-springs-pools-modernism.html', 'snippet': 'Swimming in this sun-baked desert oasis is to tour midcentury modernism as seen through its famously fabulous pools. An astonishing 40,000 pools are within the city limits. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you fly into Palm Springs, the geometry of pool-centric living is clearly laid out below, in the repeating grid of aquamarine rectangles, ovals and odd little squiggles. What is it about the swimming pool that grabs us by the hand and pulls us in? Nowhere is it more entwined with the history and culture of a place than the bright, sun-baked desert oasis of Palm Springs.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/merlin_128674763_129f256c-352a-455d-8549-fab99e49495f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/merlin_128674763_129f256c-352a-455d-8549-fab99e49495f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/merlin_128674763_129f256c-352a-455d-8549-fab99e49495f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/merlin_128674763_129f256c-352a-455d-8549-fab99e49495f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/31palmsprings5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/31palmsprings5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/travel/31palmsprings5/31palmsprings5-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headlin