27/realestate/tuckahoe-ny-an-affordable-village-with-growth-on-the-horizon.html', 'snippet': 'About 20 miles from Midtown, Tuckahoe, in southern Westchester, is a welcoming, diverse village with new construction projects in the works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amy Herzog and Jonathan Marino found northern Westchester County a bit too rural after moving to Goldens Bridge from Park Slope, Brooklyn, in 2014.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tuckahoe, N.Y.: An Affordable Village With Growth on the Horizon', 'kicker': 'Living In', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Affordable Village With Growth on the Horizon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Eastchester (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tuckahoe (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-27T10:00:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Hodara', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hodara', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57fcbc29-3b56-54a4-95d1-515edeb98181', 'word_count': 1230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57fcbc29-3b56-54a4-95d1-515edeb98181'}, {'abstract': 'Trump versus Hollywood. Echoes of the Confederacy. Taylor Swift and the alt-right. Here’s a not-so-nostalgic look back at some of the year’s fiercest fights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/27/arts/10-cultural-battles-that-ruled-2017.html', 'snippet': 'Trump versus Hollywood. Echoes of the Confederacy. Taylor Swift and the alt-right. Here’s a not-so-no