d is a humbling coda on a rough year for the company, which has been rocked by a series of scandals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — A group of Uber’s largest shareholders have agreed to sell a significant stake in the ride-hailing giant at a steep discount, according to two people familiar with the process who were not allowed to comment on it publicly.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/business/29UBER/merlin_131683544_e38ccad6-c362-43ee-9442-ad3958772de4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Uber Sells Stake to SoftBank, Valuing Ride-Hailing Giant at $48 Billion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Uber Sells Stake to SoftBank at Steep Value Drop', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Uber Technologies Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SOFTBANK Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kalanick, Travis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khosrowshahi, Dara', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-28T21:58:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Isaac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isaac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b24c27d-bc6f-525a-9d17-99e610f8ed68', 'word_count': 681, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b24c27d-bc6f-525a-9d17-99e610f8ed68'}, {'abstract': 'He founded Tomche Shabbos out of his kitchen in Brooklyn to bring food to people in need. It now distributes meals to 600 families every week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/28/obituaries/yehoshua-hershkowitz-dies-founded-kosher-meal-program.html', 'snippet': 'He founded Tomche Shabbos out of his kitchen in Brooklyn to bring food to people in need. It now distributes meals to 600 families every week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yehoshua Zvi Hershkowitz, who more than 40 years ago was so concerned that his indigent neighbors would go hungry for the Sabbath that he founded a kosher meals-on-wheels program, which has been imitated by Jewish communities around the world, died on Monday in Brooklyn. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 829, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 829}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 742, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1600, 'width': 1158, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/obituaries/29herskowitz2/29herskowitz2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yehoshua Hershkowitz, 92, Founder of a Kosher Meal Program, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yehoshua Hershkowitz, 92; Fed the Poor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hershkowitz, Yehoshua Zvi (1925-2017)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-28T22:11:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Berger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0ccc2bc-bca3-5fdb-9c4e-e461a93e7636', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0ccc2bc-bca3-5fdb-9c4e-e461a93e7636'}, {'abstract': 'The Museum of Modern Art proves that creativity is not just a young person’s game, stocking its fourth-floor galleries with works made by artists 45 and older.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/28/arts/design/the-long-run-exhibition-review-museum-of-modern-art.html', 'snippet': 'The Museum of Modern Art proves that creativity is not just a young person’s game, stocking its fourth-floor galleries with works made by artists 45 and older.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What good is an art collection if a museum doesn’t shake it up once in a while? The Museum of Modern Art has increasingly been acting on this principle. Its latest upending is “The Long Run,” a yearlong installation that is utterly engaging if slightly mild: around 130 works of art spread throughout the galleries and hallways of its fourth floor. With a couple of exceptions, these works have been made since 1970 by, as the title implies, artists with careers of some length.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/arts/29LONGRUNSUB/29LONGRUNSUB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'MoMA Upends Its Collection to Celebrate Late Careers', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Late-Life Explosions of Energy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major':