 programs at Miami, Louisville and Florida Atlantic is lapping it up this bowl season, even if he isn’t in the Hall of Fame.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. — Howard Schnellenberger’s house is like a museum. Among its items are a cartoon signed by George H.W. Bush; a note from Burt Reynolds, the movie star and former Florida State halfback; and a jersey from perhaps the greatest quarterback Schnellenberger coached, Joe Namath.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/sports/29SCHNELLweb1/merlin_130688741_426db56d-02d5-4849-a19e-8bf0809dfd3b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/29/sports/29SCHNELLweb1/merlin_130688741_426db56d-02d5-4849-a19e-8bf0809dfd3b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/sports/29SCHNELLweb1/merlin_130688741_426db56d-02d5-4849-a19e-8bf0809dfd3b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/sports/29SCHNELLweb1/merlin_130688741_426db56d-02d5-4849-a19e-8bf0809dfd3b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/sports/29SCHNELLweb1/29SCHNELLweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/29/sports/29SCHNELLweb1/29SCHNELLweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg