', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/28/us/winter-weather-erie-cold.html', 'snippet': 'Snow is blocking doors, cold has canceled New Year’s and relief is a ways off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ERIE, Pa. — Shivering, snowbound cities are scrapping their outdoor New Year’s Eve countdowns. Polar-bear plunges are being canceled because of fears of frostbite and hypothermia. Winter-hardened towns are gaping at their new lows: 32 degrees below zero in Watertown, N.Y. Minus 36 in International Falls, Minn.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/29/us/29WINTER1/29WINTER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Even Sharks Are Freezing to Death: Winter Rages and the Nation Reels', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Winter Lashes U.S. With Snow and Temperatures of 32 Below', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Erie (Pa)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cape Cod (Mass)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New England States (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Temperature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-29T01:38:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kara Murphy and Jack Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62ecc8d0-a4c2-5909-bec1-f98d9f1ab3ed', 'word_count': 1064, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62ecc8d0-a4c2-5909-bec1-f98d9f1ab3ed'}, {'abstract': 'The president said in an interview on Thursday that the special counsel will treat him fairly, contradicting a campaign by some Republicans to discredit the investigation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/28/us/politics/trump-interview-mueller-russia-china-north-korea.html', 'snippet': 'The president said in an interview on Thursday that the special counsel will treat him fairly, contradicting a campaign by some Republicans to discredit the investigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. — President Trump said Thursday that he believes Robert S. Mueller III, the special couns