snippet': 'A Saturday puzzle for connoisseurs, by Damon J. Gulczynski.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY PUZZLE — When you have finally pushed yourself and improved your solving skills to the point where you are ready to tackle a Saturday crossword, you will no doubt be of two minds. On the one hand, you will silently pray for mercy, because finding that elusive toehold will be much harder and, on the other hand, you will also want that Saturday struggle you’d heard so much about. You will want as much bang for your solving buck as you can get, and if it’s too easy, you will be left feeling vaguely disappointed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/crosswords/30wordplay-lebron/30wordplay-lebron-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/30/crosswords/30wordplay-lebron/30wordplay-lebron-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/crosswords/30wordplay-lebron/30wordplay-lebron-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/crosswords/30wordplay-lebron/30wordplay-lebron-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/crosswords/30wordplay-lebron/30wordplay-lebron-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/30/crosswords/30wordplay-lebron/30wordplay-lebron-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh