31-5594-8ba9-522289303697'}, {'abstract': 'The philanthropic set capped off 2017 with the Metropolitan Museum of Art’s Acquisitions Fund Benefit, the Berggruen Prize Gala and the New York Botanical Garden.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/29/fashion/wrapping-up-a-year-of-fund-raising.html', 'snippet': 'The philanthropic set capped off 2017 with the Metropolitan Museum of Art’s Acquisitions Fund Benefit, the Berggruen Prize Gala and the New York Botanical Garden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The philanthropic set capped off 2017 with the Metropolitan Museum of Art’s Acquisitions Fund Benefit on Dec. 14. The Berggruen Institute awarded Baroness Onora O’Neill with its $1 million Berggruen Prize for Philosophy and Culture at the New York Public Library on the same evening. And the New York Botanical Garden held its 19th annual Winter Wonderland Ball at the Enid A. Haupt Conservatory on Dec. 15.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wrapping Up a Year of Fund-Raising', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Some Philanthropy To End the Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Museum of Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Botanical Garden', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Berggruen Institute', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-29T21:23:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denny Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materi