e made in Armenia and combine a somewhat crisp texture with earthy richness: Murray’s Preserved Pumpkin, $7.99 for 10.9 ounces, Murray’s Cheese, 888-692-4339, murrayscheese.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burnerpumpkin/03Burnerpumpkin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pumpkin Preserves for the Cheese Plate', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Garnish: Pumpkin Preserves For