rd_count': 835, 'uri': 'nyt://article/753002f5-e9ef-5828-8567-1f53241134be'}, {'abstract': 'The high-profile gerrymandering case, which could have important consequences for the 2018 midterm elections, will head to the state’s Supreme Court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/29/us/pennsylvania-republicans-gerrymander.html', 'snippet': 'The high-profile gerrymandering case, which could have important consequences for the 2018 midterm elections, will head to the state’s Supreme Court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Pennsylvania judge said Friday the state’s Congressional districts were drawn to give Republicans an advantage, but they did not violate the state Constitution, ruling in a high-profile gerrymandering case with the potential to have major consequences on the 2018 midterm elections.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/30/us/30pennsylvania1/30pennsylvania1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Says Pennsylvania Election Districts Give Republicans an Edge, but Are Not Illegal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State Judge Says Election Districts Are Unfair, but They’re Not Illegal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Redistricting and Reapportionment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2018)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brobson, P Kevin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-12-30T00:02:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Trip Gabriel and Alexander Burns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Trip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gabriel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8e48335-7dd0-5e65-8d03-94bb4fb5b36b', 'word_count': 704, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8e48335-7dd0-5e65-8d03-94bb4fb5b36b'}, {'abstract': 'Rocket Broth, a new broth line from a nutritionist and cookbook writer, sells chicken bone broth and vegan broth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/29/dining/rocket-broth-for-sipping-or-souping.html', 'snippet': 'Rocket Broth, a new broth line from a nutritionist and cookbook writer, sells chicken bone broth and vegan broth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s soup season, and here are some newcomers for which the graphic designers worked overtime cramming the hype (“Broth is cool!” “Hey everyone drink broth!”) all over the packages. The brand, Rocket Broth, offers a chicken bone broth and vegan broth, both made in Brooklyn from mostly organic ingredients. Sheryl Moller, a certified health practitioner and nutrition guide, and Cree LeFavour, a cookbook writer, created the broth line. Sold in stand-up pouches, the broths are pleasant and modestly flavorful (230 to 250 milligrams of sodium help) for drinking or using in recipes. The chicken bone broth has a hefty 16 grams of protein per cup: Rocket Broth, $13.99 for 24 ounces, sold frozen, myrocketbroth.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burner-Soup/03Burner-Soup-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burner-Soup/03Burner-Soup-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burner-Soup/03Burner-Soup-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/03/dining/03Burner-Soup/03Burner-Soup-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1426, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt