66508d8-e504-5f90-a811-dbc0cd1f2c62'}, {'abstract': 'The sheriff of Douglas County in Colorado described the deputy who was killed, Zackari Parrish, as a “smiley kid” who was eager to serve.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/31/us/colorado-deputies-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'The sheriff of Douglas County in Colorado described the deputy who was killed, Zackari Parrish, as a “smiley kid” who was eager to serve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It began as a predawn call for the police to a disturbance at an apartment complex in a Denver suburb on Sunday. It ended, officials said, in a fusillade of more than 100 rounds fired by a barricaded gunman who shot five law enforcement officers, killing one of them. The gunman was killed by officers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/us/01SHOOTING4/01SHOOTING4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/31/us/01SHOOTING4/01SHOOTING4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/us/01SHOOTING4/01SHOOTING4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/us/01SHOOTING4/01SHOOTING4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/us/01SHOOTING4/01SHOOTING4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/31/us/01SHOOTING4/01SHOOTI