a former district chief at a cemetery in Nangarhar Province.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/31/world/asia/afghanistan-suicide-bomber-funeral.html', 'snippet': 'The attacker, who was on foot, set off explosives in his vest among mourners gathered for the funeral of a former district chief at a cemetery in Nangarhar Province.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — A suicide bomber walked into a cemetery in eastern Afghanistan on Sunday and blew himself up during the funeral of a local official, killing at least 17 people and wounding 14 others, an official said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/01/world/01Afghanistan-01p/merlin_131737904_1957edf5-1c58-4715-9ec1-5b2a7a224f6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/01/world/01Afghanistan-01p/merlin_131737904_1957edf5-1c58-4715-9ec1-5b2a7a224f6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/01/world/01Afghanistan-01p/merlin_131737904_1957edf5-1c58-4715-9ec1-5b2a7a224f6a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/01/world/01Afghanistan-01p/merlin_131737904_1957edf5-1c58-4715-9ec1-5b2a7a224f6a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/01/world/01Afghanistan-01p/01Afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbn