music/live-jazz-harish-raghavan-thomas-morgan-john-zorn.html', 'snippet': 'From the Borderlands Trio to Thomas Morgan to a long night at StoneFest featuring John Zorn, a look back at some of the great performances in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The true way to experience improvised music is live. More than in most other art forms, jazz’s big discoveries and developments have historically happened onstage: The music’s creation depends on an engaged, participating audience. With that in mind, we’re starting this column, recapping the most outstanding live jazz performances I’ve seen over the past month. I’m hoping that it will offer some clues as to where jazz is headed these days — and maybe even encourage you to go out and hear it for yourself.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/arts/04bestdecjazz2/merlin_131478503_93a4a464-2f9c-47f8-9ee0-a903db670f00-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/04/arts/04bestdecjazz2/merlin_131478503_93a4a464-2f9c-47f8-9ee0-a903db670f00-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/arts/04bestdecjazz2/merlin_131478503_93a4a464-2f9c-47f8-9ee0-a903db670f00-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/arts/04bestdecjazz2/merlin_131478503_93a4a464-2f9c-47f8-9ee0-a903db670f00-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/